{"id":"n62507-1-7","stage":1,"title":"설탕 · 糖","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62507-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 떡볶이 양념이 조금 더 달았으면 좋겠어요.","zh":"妈妈，我希望炒年糕的酱汁能再甜一点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"떡볶이","meaning":"辣炒年糕","explanation":"떡볶이：辣炒年糕。","readings":[{"term":"떡볶이","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15180","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡볶이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떡볶이","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3"}},{"text":"양념이","meaning":"调料，调味料，佐料","explanation":"양념：调料，调味料，佐料；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양념","audio":"/audio/c6ed85ec7cb4625c51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73135","senseId":"1","lemma":"양념","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양념이","audio":"/audio/141d91c31f3da0a129b7.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"달았으면","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；았：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달았으면","audio":"/audio/48da12fe982ab3a7aa70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"694b11f55ee86234","term":"떡볶이","zh":"辣炒年糕","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3","entryId":"15180","definition":"将长条年糕切成适当大小，加入酱油或辣椒酱等调料和各种蔬菜一同炒熟的食物。","pronunciation":["떡뽀끼"]},{"id":"c6ed85ec7cb4625c","term":"양념","zh":"调料，调味料，佐料","audio":"/audio/c6ed85ec7cb4625c51c9.mp3","entryId":"73135","definition":"调剂食物味道使变美味时使用的材料。","pronunciation":["양념"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"甜，甘甜","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62741","definition":"与蜂蜜或糖的味道相似。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c932db016fd1fc59cad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62507-1-7-2","ko":"설탕을 한 숟가락 더 넣으렴.","zh":"再加一勺糖吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"설탕을","meaning":"糖，砂糖","explanation":"설탕：糖，砂糖；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설탕","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62507","senseId":"1","lemma":"설탕","ori